will be posted on Canvas.

01:08:23.830 --> 01:08:25.130
You can ask your questions.

01:08:25.130 --> 01:08:28.590
We really, really encourage
you to ask questions on Edson

01:08:28.590 --> 01:08:30.430
and make it public.

01:08:30.430 --> 01:08:33.750
Probably if you have
a question, it's

01:08:33.750 --> 01:08:35.529
very likely others
have the same question.

01:08:35.529 --> 01:08:40.710
So please help us do
broadcast this to everybody.

01:08:40.710 --> 01:08:44.850
Edson is, again, you
can ask questions,

01:08:44.850 --> 01:08:49.170
and then Gradescope is where you
submit your project milestones

01:08:49.170 --> 01:08:50.350
and everything else.

01:08:50.350 --> 01:08:52.450
Yeah, the homeworks
and everything.

01:08:52.450 --> 01:08:54.050
We have the
following late policy

01:08:54.050 --> 01:08:58.290
that we think is
within the generous--

01:09:01.330 --> 01:09:03.430
on the generous side of things.

01:09:03.430 --> 01:09:07.270
And because the class
is big this quarter,

01:09:07.270 --> 01:09:09.390
we really can't
make any exceptions.

01:09:09.390 --> 01:09:15.170
So try to use these
late days wisely.

01:09:15.170 --> 01:09:20.729
Audits are not allowed, but
we will have the course--

01:09:20.729 --> 01:09:22.370
we will have the videos--

01:09:22.370 --> 01:09:24.090
Videos on YouTube, eventually.

01:09:24.090 --> 01:09:26.290
Eventually.

01:09:26.290 --> 01:09:27.390
And that's it.

01:09:27.390 --> 01:09:28.710
Any questions?

01:09:32.689 --> 01:09:34.029
No?

01:09:34.029 --> 01:09:35.050
All right.

01:09:35.050 --> 01:09:35.590
OK.

01:09:35.590 --> 01:09:37.720
Thanks, everyone.

